{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_10_level_main_10-12_beg","groupId":"main_10","stageId":"main_10-12","title":"瞄准","storyCode":"10-14","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_10-12_beg.txt","sourceHash":"2794ecc3c2a70c85c8e20eec762732818f8447f8f8d52bd3618d5fa5e3197945","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"10-beg"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g13_lightinduarea_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少了十三个平民，九个士兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们可真是给我添了不少麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"将军，剩下的深池士兵清点完了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给他们一个机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"愿意加入我们的，进雇佣兵编队。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不愿意的......你知道该怎么做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明白！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"说不上太精彩的战果啊，曼弗雷德将军。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没想到赦罪师的信使还未离开。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪师直属卫兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首领和摄政王一样，担忧着这个不起眼角落的战况。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信血魔大君也不例外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟，昨夜他的慷慨出手为我们减轻了不少压力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪师直属卫兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，大君托我转告您，这附近的空气过于浑浊，他并不打算耽搁太久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪师直属卫兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此刻他勉强征用了一位工厂主的住所，正在享用迟来的晚餐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"征用？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望......被大君“征用”的住所原主并不是我们的合作伙伴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪师直属卫兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这很重要吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪师直属卫兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些效率不足的厂房并不能为我们提供多少有用的资源，留着反而滋生害虫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪师直属卫兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大君的耐心只到下一个夜晚到来为止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪师直属卫兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"若您不能为他提供一场令他满意的宴会的话，他会用自己的方式“扫荡”这些肮脏的街道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是大君的意思，还是军事委员会的决定？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪师直属卫兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您总是在这些无关紧要的细节上斤斤计较，这导致了您被牵绊在这弹丸之地，而殿下对您的期望显然更高。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......烦请回报大君，感谢他先前的援手，我们会立刻进行下一阶段的行动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赦罪师直属卫兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好。我们会一起期待您的表现。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和王庭的人说话，是不是比上战场还累？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来你躲在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我保证我没偷懒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放下你那条差点弄丢了的胳膊吧。说说看，这伤是被你的老熟人炸的，还是被另一个老熟人砍的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我疼得回忆不起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反正你还有另一只手能用剑，看来她们还是留了一些情面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天快亮了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别靠在墙边发呆了。休息时间到此为止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_npc_393_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雇佣兵是没有资格请假的，对不对？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，这场仗还远远没有结束。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g7_subway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"受伤的人有多少？立刻带他们去治疗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医疗干员","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"我也来帮忙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，谢谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让哈默来见我。我们需要加快撤退的进度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有......派信使出城。最坏的情况下，我们要做好将大部分人转移去城外的准备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，指挥官！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"推进之王小姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"推进之王小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......抱歉，您的声音总是让我有些走神。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一定是太累了。我们的战士也都很疲惫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我挺好的，多谢关心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你带回来的那条情报——六队的战士是被极端恐怖的源石技艺杀害的，这对我们来说至关重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜我没有更早去地面确认他们的情况......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，那样的话你也会陷入危险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且你已经做得够好了，要不是你足够机敏，极有可能不止六队，我们其他的战士还有你们的人都会撞上他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他是谁？那些萨卡兹士兵称他为大君。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......三个月前，伦蒂尼姆北部曾经举办了一场贵族宴会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那场宴会在觥筹交错中开始，灯火亮了一整夜，直到第二天早上，前去打扫的仆人才发现，整个宴会厅里只剩下唱片机还有声响。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他人都死了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且几乎都是在同一个瞬间被杀死的。在死亡到来的那一刻，他们之中的不少人都还维持着举杯的姿势。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死者中有好几位都曾与我们保持联系。海蒂也认识他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那场宴会结束之后，我少了好几位旧友，自救军也断了一整片区域的情报渠道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们退守到城墙边缘......是有原因的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过多亏了海蒂的不懈努力，我们仍有力量保存下来，再过一段时间，我们就有机会与萨卡兹正面抗衡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但在此之前......我们仍需要从那位可怕的萨卡兹眼皮子底下全身而退。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，你会不会恰好知道他是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"假如我没猜错的话，此刻在我们头顶活跃的，恐怕是一位......血魔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g6_hideout"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......很困难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有多困难？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说实话，你让我从头做一个都比把这些碎片重新粘起来要容易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有材料了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不会吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们是在伦蒂尼姆。绝大多数工业材料都被萨卡兹控制着，我很难再碰巧扒出一些合适的废品，去做一个战场上用不着的玩具。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们这工作环境也太......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"寒酸？你想说就说吧，指挥官不在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......太具有挑战性了吧，咳咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希尔小姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么啦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你知道吗？在说到有挑战的时候，你的两只眼睛都在......“物理层面”地放光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？有吗？可能我是有些兴奋......会不会很吓人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还......还行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说实话，认识你之后，我才知道......呃，萨卡兹也不是只会打架。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噢......噢，是也有不怎么会打架的，比如说我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然咯，我是血魔嘛，也多少有一些好用的天赋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇？你你你......你这速度？你一夜之间能做完我一星期的工作吧？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不然你以为罗德岛的支柱是那么好当的啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看看我的眼睛，要是罗德岛整船都是血魔，夜间工作不用愁，电费支出都能砍一半。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"血魔里......有很多工程师吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么可能啊！他们......他们都......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，你怎么打了个寒颤？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这得怪伦蒂尼姆。我很久没有这种靠近邪恶老巢的恐怖感应了。你看，我引以为豪的手都僵住了啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_402_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道说，六队他们遇见的就是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最好不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是的话......我得给你们一个非常严肃的警告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"万一......万一你们撞见另一个血魔，跑，赶紧跑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，在撞见他们的那一刻，你们也许已经没机会了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"我希望你们永远......\n永远不要遇见他们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g7_subway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"摩根，你和因陀罗去协助自救军转移。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我也马上就过去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"维娜。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......来找我的吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我想谈谈达格达的事。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"达格达......她有自己的选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......即使我必须成为她们的领头人，我也一直在思索，我该怎么做才是最合适的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而在罗德岛，我看到了你是怎么做的。"}]},{"label":"你感觉怎么样？","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还好......只是，我很担心达格达。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但这就跟你此刻在担心我一样，博士。这是我们必须承担的。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"达格达......她和我处境很相似。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她跟在我身边的每一刻，她的行动都被责任束缚着，我嘴上说再多次让她选，她都不可能选出另一种结果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当我们真正有选择余地的时候，所谓选择的权利才是真实的。否则的话，那只是一种变相的逼迫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想再看见她被推着走。她需要接纳自己的内心，然后坚定日后的道路。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你的选择呢？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你可以像这样做一名普通战士。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你也可以向他们承认你的身份。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"无论你做什么决定，我和罗德岛都支持你。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做一名单纯的战士，说不定是一件更简单的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我的姓氏......无论你们怎么称呼我，我都无法否认自己的姓氏。这是我与生俱来的一部分。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bridge"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"希望我吐露的真相并没有吓到你，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希医生说可以由她开口，但我决定自己告诉你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你的姓氏......维多利亚？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"你的表情......好平静。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"也许因为我不记得过去。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"......不记得过去吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然你一定因此承受了不少痛苦......但我忍不住想，要是真的不记得过去，是不是能过得更轻松些？"}]},{"label":"也许因为我只关心现在。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊......最重要的，永远是现在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"在决定离开维多利亚的时候，我想要的，也不过就是此时此刻我和因陀罗她们都能活着而已。"}]},{"label":"也许因为我更着眼未来。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"未来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"我的未来......会走向何方呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"这个问题只有我自己才能回答。没有人能告诉我答案。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......和你相处，我总是这么容易就放松下来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"也许是因为......就连你得知真相的这一刻，当你看着我的时候，你的眼里依然只是我这个叫“推进之王”的干员......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"char_112_seige","isRemote":false,"text":"而不是......维多利亚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g7_subway"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回到伦蒂尼姆之后，我找到了许多回忆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"与此同时，我也看到了更多变化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我所做出的每一个决定，已经不再仅仅关系着我们小队。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士......我并不希望“选择”成为一个使我停滞不前的借口。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"是一个个选择让我走到今天。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"是一个个选择决定了前进的方向。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"有人跟我说，我会找到我的道路。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"维娜，这句话，我也想送给你。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你永远都有选择的权利。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g6_hideout"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......海蒂女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅？我正在照看我们这些受伤的战士......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您......还会医术？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是一些粗浅的护理知识。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这份工作难免会让我遇到一些危急时刻，为了让我和朋友们有更多活下来的机会，我至少得学会应急药箱怎么用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您很了不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们做的不过是守护自己的家园。而凯尔希......还有你，阿米娅，你们肩负着更多的责任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......在这次行动中，我们损失了很多人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我感受到了自救军战士的痛苦。他们之前对付的敌人都没有那么可怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位血魔大君......他之所以会来这里，是不是因为我们的出现？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，你需要的并不是一个否定的答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克洛维希娅说过，她担心我和罗德岛将自救军卷入不属于他们的战场中去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果合作的确给他们带来了更大的危险......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨夜的行动，假如没有罗德岛的参与，会发生什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有W里应外合，没有她挡住那位雇佣兵首领......也没有其他罗德岛干员牵制曼弗雷德，我们之间的这场交谈根本没有机会发生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用一些人命去换另一些人命的计算方式，对于罗德岛来说，当然并不成立——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_400_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但即便是凯尔希在这里，她也一定会说，任何机遇都伴随着风险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是为什么我们必须做更多准备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海蒂女士，我需要更多城内的情报。除了血魔大君，萨卡兹还有哪几位王在伦蒂尼姆？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g9_lightinduarea_street_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麻烦给我一袋面包。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姑娘，我不要你们的钱了。这些面包你都拿去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赶紧走吧，以后都别再上街了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您的意思是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你们是谁。其实，我们都看得出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算你们脱下了装备，换了衣服，你们的眼神和动作都骗不了人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......谢谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_418_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也要回家了。我看今天这生意是做不成了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"这条街挨个搜一遍！凡是在名单上的，全部带走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_416_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎、怎么了？我......我就是个做餐馆生意的啊，您之前不还在我这儿吃过炸鳞肉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"抓的就是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"你藏得还挺深啊，白天卖炸肉给我们，晚上立刻给反抗军送消息？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"带走！还有隔壁钟表店的老板，这些都是反抗军的人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_4039_horn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么萨卡兹会突然四处抓人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快，快走，从前面巷子里拐进去，去找其他人——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"这个也解决了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"你们，追进前面巷子里，往其他城区跑的，一个都别放过。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g12_satellite"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"报告，我们刚出来就撞上了萨卡兹......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，他们不是守着我们的出城通道，就是突然在半道上冒出来的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"指挥官，难道是我们的通讯讯息被截获了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您一定要小心......派出城的战士已经全部牺牲了......我也躲不了多久！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g9_lightinduarea_street_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该死，怎么都甩不掉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹好像突然摸清楚了我们在地面上的全部行动路线！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是......只是一夜之间......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天晚上到底发生了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，你们没机会知道了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——？什么人？为什么我的刀断了一截——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您这身打扮......您是罗德岛干员？谢谢......罗德岛又救了我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"快回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"不，转告博士和阿米娅，地下也不安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天我们遇到的陷阱......不止我们已经发现的那些。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["医疗干员"]},{"speakerId":"char_112_seige","aliases":["推进之王"]}]}
